  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "flow",
      "x": -520,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 420,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Console direction, built out.\n\nNo status page: the root redirects to sign-in, and a signed-in administrator lands on Users. The sidebar replaces the old single admin page; each list gets its own page with room for its columns.\n\nRow 1: sign-in, plain and after a wrong password.\nRow 2: the three admin pages.\nRow 3: the same shell in dark appearance."
    },
    {
      "id": "other",
      "x": -520,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 420,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "The two directions not chosen for the console, and below them the grants-page directions not chosen (A, B, C, D, F, H), kept for reference."
    },
    {
      "id": "chosen-e",
      "x": -520,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 420,
      "page": "page-3",
      "text": "Chosen direction: tabbed detail pages, no Grants page.\n\nRow 1: the Groups list opens a group; its page has Members, Connections and Details tabs.\nRow 2: the Users list carries counts only; a user's page has Groups, Access, Sessions and Details tabs. Access lists every connection with the path it comes through (\"direct \u00b7 also via finance-managers\").\nRow 3: a connection's Access tab lists the groups granted and every person who can use it, with the group they come through.\n\nThe sidebar has three entries: Users, Groups, Connections. Demo data: two groups, two members, two connections, one direct grant."
    }
  ],
